                number: 1,
                title: "The Pattern Nobody Talks About",
                subtitle: "Every culture felt the same thing",
                emoji: "🌍",
                sections: [
                    AwakeningSection(heading: "One Current, Eight Names", body: "Here's something that should stop you in your tracks.\n\nThe ancient Chinese called it Chi.\nThe ancient Indians called it Prana.\nThe yogis called its coiled form Kundalini.\nAn Austrian scientist called it Orgone.\nThe Greeks called it Ether.\nThe Polynesians called it Mana.\nThe Christians called it the Holy Spirit.\nThe mystics called it Divine Energy.\nThe occultists called it Astral Energy.\n\nDifferent continents. Different millennia. Different languages. Zero contact between most of these cultures.\n\nAnd they all described the same thing: an invisible force that flows through everything, connects everything, and animates everything. A universal current that you can't see with your eyes but can feel in your body when you're deeply focused, calm, or alive with purpose.\n\nThey described it flowing through the human body in channels — the Chinese mapped meridians, the Indians mapped nadis, the Kabbalists mapped the Tree of Life. They described it flowing through nature — in sunlight, water, earth, wind. They described it flowing through the cosmos — connecting stars, planets, and consciousness itself.\n\nThey said when this energy flows freely, you're healthy, clear, and aligned. When it gets blocked, you feel sick, stuck, anxious, or dead inside.\n\nThey built entire systems of medicine, martial arts, meditation, and spiritual practice around unblocking this flow.\n\nAnd here's the part that changes everything: if every culture on Earth independently discovered the same invisible force... maybe it's not mythology. Maybe they were all measuring the same reality with different instruments."),
                    AwakeningSection(heading: "Why This Matters More Than You Think", body: "This isn't just an interesting historical footnote. It's the key to the biggest realization in this entire course.\n\nIf the same energy flows through EVERYTHING — through you, through me, through every person on every continent in every era — then separation is an illusion.\n\nWe're not different races. We're the same energy expressing itself through different bodies shaped by geography, climate, and time.\n\nWe're not different religions. We're the same consciousness reaching for the same source using different languages.\n\nWe're not different species of human. We're fractals of the whole — individual expressions of one unified field, experiencing the universe through billions of unique perspectives simultaneously.\n\nYou are the universe looking at itself through your eyes.\nI am the universe looking at itself through mine.\nShe is the universe looking through hers.\nThey are the universe looking through theirs.\n\nWe are not drops in the ocean. We ARE the ocean, temporarily expressing itself as drops.\n\nOnce you see this — really see it, not just intellectually understand it — you can't hate anyone. How do you hate yourself? Because that's what hating another person is. It's one fractal of the whole attacking another fractal of the same whole.\n\nThere would be no wars if everyone saw this. There CAN'T be wars when you realize the enemy is you, wearing a different face, born in a different place, carrying different trauma, running different shadow code — but animated by the exact same force.\n\nThe only thing preventing this realization? Ego. That loud, persistent voice telling you that you're separate. That you're special. That you're different. That THEY are different. That you need to compete, dominate, defend, and validate your existence against other fractals of yourself.\n\nShut up already.\n\nLet's look at each energy system and see the same current flowing through all of them."),
